{"slug":"Leetcode-35-Search-Insert-Position","title":"Leetcode#35. Search Insert Position","date":"2023-07-26","updated":"","tags":["Leetcode","Python","easy","💡","Array","Binary Search"],"categories":["Leetcode"],"cover":"/img/cover/leetcode.jpg","excerpt":"Given a sorted array of distinct integers and a target value, return the index if the target is found. If not, return the index where it would be if it were inserted in order. You must write an algori","sticky":0,"contentHtml":"<h1 id=\"problem\"><a href=\"#problem\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Problem</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<p>Given a sorted array of distinct integers and a target value, return the index if the target is found. If not, return the index where it would be if it were inserted in order.</p>\n<p>You must write an algorithm with <span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>O(log n)</span></span></code></span> runtime complexity.</p>\n<p><strong>Example 1:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 5</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 2:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Example 3:</strong></p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Input: nums = [1,3,5,6], target = 7</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span>Output: 4</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span></code></pre></figure>\n<p><strong>Constraints:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>1 &#x3C;= nums.length &#x3C;= 10^4</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>10^4 &#x3C;= nums[i] &#x3C;= 10^4</span></span></code></span></li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>nums</span></span></code></span> contains <strong>distinct</strong> values sorted in <strong>ascending</strong> order.</li>\n<li><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>10^4 &#x3C;= target &#x3C;= 10^4</span></span></code></span></li>\n</ul>\n<h1 id=\"solve\"><a href=\"#solve\"><span data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><code data-language=\"text\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\"><span data-line=\"\"><span>Solve</span></span></code></span></a></h1>\n<h2 id=\"就使用-二分搜尋演算\"><a href=\"#就使用-二分搜尋演算\">就使用 <strong>二分搜尋演算</strong></a></h2>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">class</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B\"> Solution</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">    def</span><span style=\"color:#61AFEF\"> searchInsert</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E5C07B;font-style:italic\">self</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">nums</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: List[</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">], </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66;font-style:italic\">target</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">) -> </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">int</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        </span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        left </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">        right </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">(nums)</span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        while</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> left </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> right:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">            mid </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> (left </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> right) </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">//</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            if</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> nums[mid] </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">==</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> target:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">                return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> mid</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            elif</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> target </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> nums[mid]:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                right </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> mid </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">-</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">            else</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">:</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">                left </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">  mid </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">+</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#C678DD\">        return</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> left</span></span></code></pre></figure>\n<p>最後return left為 target 不在nums 裡</p>\n<p>所以應該插在 left 這位置</p>\n<p>如果要確切找到，就 return false，代表沒有在裏頭</p>\n<figure data-rehype-pretty-code-figure=\"\"><pre style=\"background-color:#282c34;color:#abb2bf\" tabindex=\"0\" data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\"><code data-language=\"python\" data-theme=\"one-dark-pro\" style=\"display: grid;\"><span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">nums </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">2</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\"> , </span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\">4</span><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">]</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#ABB2BF\">target </span><span style=\"color:#56B6C2\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D19A66\"> 3</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'''</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">left = 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">right = 2-1  = 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">iter1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\tmid = (0+1)//2 = 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\t進入 else</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\tleft = mid + 1 = 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">iter2</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\tmid = (1+1)//2 = 1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\ttarget &#x3C; nums[mid]   3&#x3C;4</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">\tright = mid - 1 = 0</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">iterEND</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">return left</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">1</span></span>\n<span data-line=\"\"> </span>\n<span data-line=\"\"><span style=\"color:#98C379\">'''</span></span></code></pre></figure>"}